<% content_for :title, "Sobre NEQUIS - Las Creadoras" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Conoce a Joseling, Greyschell y Cinthia, las creadoras detrás de NEQUIS. Creatividad, calidad y pasión por transformar tus ideas en regalos personalizados." %>
<% content_for :theme_color, "#FBFBF9" %>
<% content_for :body_class, "bg-[#FBFBF9] text-brand-navy font-brand-sans antialiased selection:bg-brand-indigo selection:text-white" %>
<% content_for :oasis_layout, true %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Sobre NEQUIS - Las Creadoras">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Tres jóvenes emprendedoras unidas por el diseño, la creatividad y la personalización. Conoce la historia detrás de NEQUIS.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="<%= image_url "nequis/creadora-joseling.jpg" %>">
<% end %>

<main class="w-full pt-8 pb-20">
  <!-- Hero / Intro -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 pt-12 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-border bg-white text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-indigo font-medium mb-6 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Historia &amp; Identidad • NEQUIS
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-editorial text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-brand-navy font-normal tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6">
        Detrás de cada detalle: <br>
        <span class="italic font-light text-brand-indigo">Conoce a las creadoras de NEQUIS</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-muted font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Tres visionarias unidas por el arte del detalle, la creatividad artesanal y la pasión por inmortalizar momentos especiales a través de la sublimación de alta precisión y el DTF textil.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Las Creadoras -->
  <section id="creadoras" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 pb-24 scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-brand-border pb-6 mb-12">
      <div>
        <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo/80 block mb-2">Las Mentes y Corazones</span>
        <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-brand-navy font-normal">Las Creadoras de NEQUIS</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted mt-3 md:mt-0 font-medium">
        Taller Creativo — Managua &amp; Online
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Joseling -->
      <article class="bg-brand-card border border-brand-border/70 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-sand mb-6">
            <%= image_tag "nequis/creadora-joseling.jpg",
                  alt: "Joseling Bermúdez — Co-fundadora y Diseñadora Creativa",
                  class: "w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[15%] group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500",
                  loading: "lazy",
                  decoding: "async" %>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-navy border border-white/60 shadow-sm">
                Co-fundadora
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-indigo font-semibold block mb-1">
              Creatividad &amp; Diseño
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium">Joseling Bermúdez</h3>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
            “La mente creativa encargada de dar vida visual a cada idea, ilustrar con amor y convertir pensamientos en diseños hermosos y vibrantes listos para sublimar.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/60 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#IlustraciónCreativa</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#DirecciónDeArte</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#DiseñoConAlma</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Greyschell -->
      <article class="bg-brand-card border border-brand-border/70 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-sand mb-6">
            <%= image_tag "nequis/creadora-greyschell.jpg",
                  alt: "Greyschell Alemán — Co-fundadora y Marketing",
                  class: "w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[15%] group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500",
                  loading: "lazy",
                  decoding: "async" %>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-navy border border-white/60 shadow-sm">
                Co-fundadora
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-accent font-semibold block mb-1">
              Marketing &amp; Identidad de Marca
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium">Greyschell Alemán</h3>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
            “La voz y el corazón comunicativo de NEQUIS. Conecta con nuestra hermosa comunidad, cuida la identidad de nuestra marca y asegura que cada historia llegue al corazón adecuado.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/60 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#BrandIdentity</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#ComunidadNEQUIS</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#MarketingDigital</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Cinthia -->
      <article class="bg-brand-card border border-brand-border/70 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-sand mb-6">
            <%= image_tag "nequis/creadora-cinthia.jpg",
                  alt: "Cinthia García — Co-fundadora y Control de Calidad",
                  class: "w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[15%] group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500",
                  loading: "lazy",
                  decoding: "async" %>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-navy border border-white/60 shadow-sm">
                Co-fundadora
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-indigo font-semibold block mb-1">
              Gestión &amp; Personalización
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium">Cinthia García</h3>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
            “La guardiana de la calidad y la producción. Coordina cada pedido, supervisa los tiempos, calibra los colores y se asegura de que cada taza, polera o cojín quede perfecto e impecable.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/60 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#ControlDeCalidad</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#AtenciónPersonalizada</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-wide text-brand-navy/70 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border/70 font-medium">#ProducciónConAmor</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Nuestra Historia -->
  <section id="historia" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 border-t border-brand-border scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo block">Nuestra Historia</span>
        <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-brand-navy font-normal leading-[1.2]">
          El origen de NEQUIS: <br>
          <span class="italic text-brand-muted font-light">de una pasión compartida a un sueño hecho realidad.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 pt-2 text-brand-muted text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-brand-navy font-normal text-lg sm:text-xl">
          NEQUIS surge como una iniciativa de tres jóvenes emprendedoras que comparten el interés por el diseño, la creatividad y el mundo de la personalización.
        </p>
        <p>
          A partir de la idea de crear una marca que permitiera a las personas expresar su personalidad a través de productos únicos, nació este proyecto enfocado en la sublimación de alta calidad y la creación de detalles inolvidables.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-navy/60 font-medium">
          <span>Calidad Artesanal</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
          <span>Identidad Propia</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
          <span>Sublimación &amp; DTF</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-16">
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-sand flex items-center justify-center text-brand-indigo">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">flag</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo">Propósito</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-4">Nuestra misión</h3>
          <p class="font-editorial text-xl sm:text-2xl text-brand-navy/80 italic leading-relaxed">
            “Crear productos personalizados mediante la sublimación, combinando creatividad, calidad y originalidad para hacer realidad las ideas de nuestros clientes.”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/70 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-indigo font-medium">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
          <span>Compromiso artesanal en cada entrega</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-sand flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">visibility</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-accent">Futuro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-4">Nuestra visión</h3>
          <p class="font-editorial text-xl sm:text-2xl text-brand-navy/80 italic leading-relaxed">
            “Ser una marca reconocida por transformar ideas en productos únicos, destacando por nuestra creatividad, calidad e innovación.”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-brand-border/70 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-accent font-medium">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">stars</span>
          <span>Innovación constante con identidad propia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Nuestros Valores -->
  <section id="valores" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-20 border-t border-brand-border scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo block mb-2">El Manifiesto NEQUIS</span>
      <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-brand-navy font-normal mb-3">Nuestros Valores</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted font-light leading-relaxed">
        Los cinco pilares esenciales que guían cada diseño, cada estampación y cada sonrisa entregada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F4F1F8] flex items-center justify-center text-brand-indigo mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">palette</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-1.5">Creatividad</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">Ideas originales en cada diseño.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-indigo font-medium flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-brand-border/60 pt-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">brush</span>
          <span>Diseños únicos</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FAF5EC] flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-1.5">Calidad</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">Cuidado en cada detalle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-accent font-medium flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-brand-border/60 pt-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">task_alt</span>
          <span>Sublimación pura</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F4F1F8] flex items-center justify-center text-brand-indigo mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">fingerprint</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-1.5">Originalidad</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">Productos con identidad propia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-indigo font-medium flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-brand-border/60 pt-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">star</span>
          <span>100% personalizados</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FAF5EC] flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-1.5">Compromiso</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">Responsabilidad con clientes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-accent font-medium flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-brand-border/60 pt-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">support_agent</span>
          <span>Cercanía total</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#F4F1F8] flex items-center justify-center text-brand-indigo mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">favorite</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl text-brand-navy font-medium mb-1.5">Pasión</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light mb-4">Amor por lo que hacemos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-indigo font-medium flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-brand-border/60 pt-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">volunteer_activism</span>
          <span>Con el corazón</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tips de las Creadoras -->
  <section id="tips" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-12 scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="bg-brand-card border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10" data-controller="creator-tabs">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-brand-border/70">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo block mb-1">Secretos de Taller</span>
          <h2 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-medium">Un tip de cada creadora para tu regalo perfecto</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted font-light mt-1">Haz clic para descubrir sus recomendaciones favoritas de personalización</p>
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex p-1 bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-full" role="tablist" aria-label="Consejos de las creadoras">
          <button id="tab-btn-joseling" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider transition-all bg-brand-navy text-white" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tab-joseling" data-creator-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate" data-key="joseling">
            Joseling
          </button>
          <button id="tab-btn-greyschell" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted hover:text-brand-navy transition-all" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-greyschell" data-creator-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate" data-key="greyschell">
            Greyschell
          </button>
          <button id="tab-btn-cinthia" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted hover:text-brand-navy transition-all" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tab-cinthia" data-creator-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->creator-tabs#select keydown->creator-tabs#navigate" data-key="cinthia">
            Cinthia
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="tab-joseling" class="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-6" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-joseling" data-creator-tabs-target="panel" data-key="joseling">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-sand border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center text-brand-indigo flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]" aria-hidden="true">auto_fix_high</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-1">
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl text-brand-navy font-medium">El consejo de diseño de Joseling</h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-brand-indigo bg-[#F4F1F8] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">Ilustración &amp; Color</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light">
            “No te preocupes si no tienes una foto con resolución de estudio. Si tiene valor emocional, nosotras la vectorizamos, retocamos luces y estilizamos para que resalte con nitidez absoluta sobre cualquier superficie cerámica o textil.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="tab-greyschell" class="pt-8 hidden flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-6" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-btn-greyschell" data-creator-tabs-target="panel" data-key="greyschell">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#FAF5EC] border border-brand-border flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]" aria-hidden="true">sentiment_satisfied</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-1">
            <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl text-brand-navy font-medium">El tip emocional de Greyschell</h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-brand-accent bg-[#FAF5EC] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">Experiencia &amp; Emoción</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-light">
            “Los mejores regalos son aquellos que rescatan pequeños chistes internos o fechas clave. Añadir un código Spotify que reproduzca su canción preferida al escanear la taza o una dedicatoria oculta en la base siempre causa impacto.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

